    <p class="eyebrow mb-3">06 / llms.txt</p>
    <h2>llms.txt: what it is and what Google says</h2>

    <p>llms.txt is a plain-text file at your domain root that describes your site for AI tools, documented at <a href="https://llmstxt.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">llmstxt.org</a>. Google says Search does not use it and that it neither helps nor hurts rankings. Other services may read it.</p>

    <p>Keeping one is harmless and I will set one up if you want it. I do not sell it as a way to get cited.</p>

